Z||000000||FieroKyle||12-05-2001||06:19 PM||||Alright, I made the 8ball shifter as some of you know.<P>When I used threads from the 8ball it went on fine other than it being sorta tight.<P>Then I redrilled it and put in a peice of aluminum for threads. I used the same tap and everything. It won't fit.<P>Then I realized that the size of the shifter has to be metric. I used a 5/8's since the leather shifter fit perfectly on a fine thread 5/8 bolt. Apparently this isn't so.<P>So whats the size of the shifter anyways?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierokylesig_1.gif">      <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||9
